"Uses 30 Hz, faster ordered disk writes, and non-experimental CPU settings. The code-cache size follows your signing entitlement. Quit and reopen Henge before the next Mac session. This reduces graphics overhead; it does not eliminate macOS 27 emulation costs." = "设置为 30 Hz、较快的顺序磁盘写入，并关闭实验性 CPU 选项。代码缓存大小根据签名权限自动确定。下次运行 Mac 前请彻底退出并重启 Henge。此预设可降低图形绘制负担，但无法消除 macOS 27 的模拟开销。";
